[題目]  
In MongoDB one-to-many relationship modeling, a blogging platform stores authors and their blog posts. Each author can have hundreds of posts, and the application frequently needs to display an author's profile page showing their 5 most recent posts along with full author details on every post page. A developer is deciding between three approaches: (A) embed all posts inside the author document, (B) store posts in a separate collection with an author reference, and also store a 'recentPosts' array of the 5 latest post summaries inside the author document, or (C) store posts in a separate collection with only an author reference. Which approach best balances read performance and data consistency for this use case? (difficulty: hard)
在 MongoDB 的一對多關係建模中，一個部落格平台儲存作者及其發表的文章。每位作者可能擁有數百篇文章，且應用程式頻繁需要顯示作者個人頁面（展示最新的 5 篇文章）以及在每篇文章頁面顯示完整作者資訊。開發者正在考慮三種做法：(A) 將所有文章內嵌於作者文件中、(B) 將文章獨立儲存於另一個集合並引用作者，同時在作者文件中維護包含最新 5 篇文章摘要的 'recentPosts' 陣列、(C) 將文章獨立儲存於另一個集合且僅做作者引用。針對此情境，哪種做法能最佳平衡讀取效能與資料一致性？（難度：高）

[選項]  
A. Store posts in a separate collection with an author reference, and store a 'recentPosts' summary array inside the author document (Extended Reference / Subset pattern)
B. Embed all posts inside the author document, because embedding always provides the best read performance by avoiding joins
C. Store posts in a separate collection with only an author reference, and rely solely on $lookup aggregation to join data at query time
D. Store posts in a separate collection and embed the full author document inside every post document, so each post is fully self-contained

[正確答案]：
A

[核心考點]： 

[詳細解析]：
本題考查 Subset Pattern 與 Extended Reference Pattern。每位作者可有數百篇文章，若全內嵌會導致文件過大；若僅用引用則讀取需頻繁 Join。採用混合模式（快取最新 5 篇）能最佳兼顧讀取速度與維護性。

A. 正確，運用 Subset/Extended Reference 模式，既避免大文件過膨，又兼顧高效讀取。
B. 錯誤，數百篇文章全內嵌易觸發 16MB 限制且會造成 Unbounded Array 反模式。
C. 錯誤，每次載入個人頁面都必須使用 $lookup，會增加系統昂貴的聚合計算成本。
D. 錯誤，將完整作者內嵌至每篇文章，若作者資料更新需修改大量文章，一致性成本極高。

