[題目]  
In MongoDB document modeling, one-to-one relationships can be represented using embedding or referencing. A developer is building a healthcare application where each 'patient' document has a corresponding 'medicalRecord' document. The medical record contains highly sensitive data subject to strict access control, is accessed by a separate internal audit system independently from the patient document, and is never shared across multiple patients. Each patient has exactly one medical record. The combined document size if embedded would be approximately 4KB, well within MongoDB's 16MB limit, and the data is accessed together in roughly 60% of all queries. Which factor MOST strongly justifies using a reference rather than embedding the medical record directly inside the patient document? (difficulty: hard)
在 MongoDB 文件建模中，一對一關係可透過內嵌或引用來表示。開發者正在建置醫療應用程式，每位「病患 (patient)」文件有對應的「病歷 (medicalRecord)」文件。病歷包含嚴格存取控制的高敏感資料、被獨立稽核系統單獨存取，且不跨病患共享。合併後大小約 4KB（遠小於 16MB 限制），且約 60% 查詢會同時讀取兩者。哪項因素最強烈支持採用引用而非直接內嵌？（難度：高）

[選項]  
A. The combined document size of 4KB approaches MongoDB's document size limits, making referencing a safer choice to avoid hitting the 16MB cap.
B. MongoDB does not support embedding documents that contain sensitive data, so referencing must be used when privacy constraints are present.
C. The medical record is accessed independently by a separate system and requires its own access control boundaries, making it more appropriate as a standalone document.
D. Since only 60% of queries access both documents together, the read pattern does not favor embedding and referencing would reduce unnecessary data retrieval.

[正確答案]：
C

[核心考點]： 

[詳細解析]：
獨立的存取控制需求與被外部系統單獨讀取的模式，是決定獨立成集合的核心原因。分開儲存能確保權限邊界明確，避免敏感資料暴露。

A. 錯誤，4KB 遠小於 16MB 上限，完全無爆表疑慮。
B. 錯誤，MongoDB 功能上支援內嵌敏感資料，非資料庫底層限制。
C. 正確，獨立存取需求與存取控制邊界（Access Control）是最強烈的理由。
D. 錯誤，60% 一起讀取依然偏高，非選擇引用的最主要關鍵。

