[題目]  
In MongoDB one-to-many relationship modeling, a social media platform stores user accounts and their comments. Each user can post tens of thousands of comments over time, and comments are always displayed in the context of a post - never on a user's profile page. A developer is choosing between: (A) embedding all comments as an array inside the user document, (B) using the subset pattern - embedding only the 10 most recent comments inside the user document while storing all comments in a separate collection, or (C) storing all comments in a separate collection with a user reference field, without any embedding. Which approach is most appropriate given these access patterns and data volume? (difficulty: hard)
在 MongoDB 一對多關係建模中，社群媒體平台儲存使用者帳號及其留言。每位使用者隨時間推移可能會發表數萬條留言，且留言永遠在「文章（post）」情境下展示，絕不會在「使用者個人頁面」顯示。開發者正在考慮：(A) 將所有留言作為陣列內嵌在使用者文件中、(B) 使用 Subset Pattern——在使用者文件中僅內嵌最近 10 條留言，同時將所有留言存於獨立集合、或 (C) 將所有留言存於獨立集合並帶有使用者引用欄位，不進行任何內嵌。考量此存取模式與資料量，哪種方法最合適？（難度：高）

[選項]  
A. Approach A - embed all comments as an array inside the user document, because embedding guarantees the fastest read performance by avoiding joins.
B. Approach B - use the subset pattern by embedding the 10 most recent comments inside the user document alongside a separate comments collection, because it balances read performance with bounded document size.
C. Approach A - embed all comments as an array inside the user document, but apply document sharding to handle the 16 MB document size limit.
D. Approach C - store all comments in a separate collection with a user reference field, because comments are never accessed from the user context and the volume is unbounded.

[正確答案]：
D

[核心考點]： 

[詳細解析]：
留言數高達數萬筆（資料無界限），且存取模式「絕不在使用者頁面展示留言」，因此在使用者文件中快取或內嵌留言皆無實益，應採用獨立集合儲存。

A. 錯誤，數萬條留言會導致單一文件爆表（超過 16MB 限制）。
B. 錯誤，留言從不在使用者頁面讀取，快取最近 10 條留言屬無效設計。
C. 錯誤，Sharding 是以集合為單位分片，無法解決「單一文件超過 16MB」限制。
D. 正確，符合資料量無限增長且讀取情境不需從使用者端存取的特性。

