[題目]  
In MongoDB's document model fundamentals, a developer is modeling an e-commerce application. Each order document needs to store the customer's shipping address. The shipping address is always queried together with the order and is specific to that order - it never needs to be queried or updated independently. A senior developer suggests two approaches: (A) embed the shipping address as a sub-document directly inside the order document, or (B) store shipping addresses in a separate 'addresses' collection and reference them by _id. Which of the following best describes the primary advantage of approach (A) over approach (B) in this specific scenario? (difficulty: medium)
在 MongoDB 的文件模型基礎中，開發者正在建置電子商務應用程式。每個訂單文件需要儲存顧客的送貨地址。送貨地址總是與訂單一起被查詢，且為該訂單專屬——絕不需要獨立被查詢或更新。資深開發者提出兩種做法：(A) 將送貨地址作為子文件直接內嵌在訂單文件內部，或 (B) 將送貨地址存於獨立的 'addresses' 集合並透過 _id 引用。在此特定情境下，下列哪一項最準確地說明了做法 (A) 相較於做法 (B) 的主要優勢？（難度：中等）

[選項]  
A. Approach (A) allows the shipping address fields to have a strictly enforced schema, preventing any document in the collection from storing addresses with missing or extra fields.
B. Approach (A) reduces the total storage space used by the database because embedded sub-documents are compressed more efficiently than documents stored in separate collections.
C. Approach (A) makes it easier to update a customer's shipping address across all orders simultaneously, since the address data is centralized within each order document.
D. Approach (A) eliminates the need for a separate read operation (join-like lookup) to retrieve the shipping address when fetching an order, improving read performance for this access pattern.

[正確答案]：
D

[核心考點]： 

[詳細解析]：
當資料總是與父文件一起讀取時，將其內嵌（Embedding）能在單次 I/O 取得所有資料，避免二次查詢（Join/Lookup），極大地提升讀取效能。

A. 錯誤，MongoDB 嚴格 Schema 驗證（Schema Validation）是針對 Collection，與內嵌無直接關係。
B. 錯誤，壓縮率主要取決於底層儲存引擎（WiredTiger），非內嵌子文件的特性。
C. 錯誤，內嵌反而使跨訂單更新同一地址變得困難，非其優勢。
D. 正確，符合內嵌核心優勢：消除額外讀取操作（Lookup），極大提升讀取效能。

