[題目]  
In MongoDB, when deciding between embedding vs referencing documents, a developer is modeling a multi-tenant SaaS application. Each tenant (company) has a configuration document that stores their active feature flags - typically 10 to 20 boolean fields updated together during a configuration change. The application loads the full configuration on every user login and never needs to query individual feature flags across tenants. However, the same configuration must also be audited, meaning every change is recorded with a timestamp and the previous state. The audit log can grow to thousands of entries per tenant over time. Which approach best fits this scenario? (difficulty: hard)
在 MongoDB 中決定內嵌（embedding）與引用（referencing）文件時，開發者正在建立一個多租戶 SaaS 應用程式。每個租戶（公司）都有一個設定文件來儲存其啟用的功能標記（feature flags）——通常在設定變更時會一起更新 10 到 20 個布林值欄位。應用程式在每次使用者登入時都會載入完整的設定，且絕不需要跨租戶查詢單一功能標記。然而，該設定同時必須進行稽核，這意味著每次變更都會記錄時間戳記與先前的狀態。隨著時間推移，每個租戶的稽核日誌可能成長到數千條。哪種做法最適合此情境？（難度：高）

[選項]  
A. Embed the configuration inside the tenant document, and reference the audit log entries as separate documents in an audits collection.
B. Reference both the configuration and the audit log as separate documents, storing only IDs in the tenant document.
C. Embed both the configuration and the full audit log inside the tenant document.
D. Embed the configuration inside the tenant document, and also embed the audit log but cap it at the 100 most recent entries using application logic.

[正確答案]：
A

[核心考點]： 

[詳細解析]：
設定檔資料量小且每次登入皆需載入，適合內嵌以利單次 I/O 讀取；稽核日誌會無限制增長至數千筆，若內嵌會引發文件爆表，故應獨立儲存並採用引用。

A. 正確，兼顧設定檔高效讀取，同時避免無界限的稽核日誌造成文件膨脹。
B. 錯誤，設定檔資料量極小且頻繁讀取，分離儲存會增加不必要的二次查詢成本。
C. 錯誤，稽核日誌會成長至數千筆，內嵌會觸發 16MB 文件大小限制。
D. 錯誤，稽核紀錄需完整保留，截斷至最近 100 筆會遺失歷史稽核資料，不符業務需求。

