[題目]  
In MongoDB schema design, the Extended Reference Pattern is used to embed a subset of frequently accessed fields from a referenced document directly into the referencing document, avoiding costly $lookup operations at read time. A developer is building a video streaming platform where each Video document stores an extended reference to its Creator (a User document). The Creator document contains: userId, displayName, channelDescription, subscriberCount, totalVideosUploaded, and profilePictureUrl. The platform displays video cards showing the video title, thumbnail, and the creator's displayName and profilePictureUrl. The subscriberCount field is updated hundreds of times per day as users subscribe and unsubscribe. Which of the following is the MOST accurate statement about how the Extended Reference Pattern affects the design decision for this scenario? (difficulty: hard)
在 MongoDB 的 Schema 設計中，擴充引用模式（Extended Reference Pattern）用於將被引用文件中一部分高頻存取的欄位直接內嵌至引用文件中，以避免讀取時執行昂貴的 $lookup 操作。開發者正在建置影音串流平台，每個影片（Video）文件都儲存對其創作者（Creator，即 User 文件）的擴充引用。創作者文件包含：userId、displayName、channelDescription、subscriberCount、totalVideosUploaded 及 profilePictureUrl。平台顯示的影片卡片會展示影片標題、縮圖以及創作者的 displayName 與 profilePictureUrl。而 subscriberCount 欄位因使用者訂閱與取消訂閱，每天會更新數百次。下列哪一項最準確地說明了擴充引用模式如何影響此情境的設計決策？（難度：高）

[選項]  
A. The developer should embed subscriberCount in the Video document because it is a frequently changing field, and the Extended Reference Pattern is specifically designed to keep high-volatility fields synchronized across documents.
B. The developer should embed displayName and profilePictureUrl in Video documents, and accept that subscriberCount should NOT be embedded because its high update frequency would cause excessive write amplification across all Video documents.
C. The Extended Reference Pattern requires embedding all Creator fields into the Video document to ensure that no $lookup operations are ever needed when rendering video cards.
D. Because the Extended Reference Pattern embeds data at write time, the developer should embed all fields including subscriberCount, channelDescription, and totalVideosUploaded to future-proof the schema against new UI requirements.

[正確答案]：
B

[核心考點]： 

[詳細解析]：
擴充引用模式只應複製「高頻讀取且低頻變動」的資料。`subscriberCount` 變動極頻繁，若內嵌會導致更新創作者時需要同步更新旗下所有影片文件，引發嚴重的寫入放大。

A. 錯誤，擴充引用模式不適合用於高揮發性（高頻更新）的欄位。
B. 正確，僅內嵌低頻變更的展示欄位，排除高頻更新欄位以避免寫入放大。
C. 錯誤，該模式主張僅內嵌「部分/子集」欄位而非全部內嵌。
D. 錯誤，盲目內嵌非必需且高頻變動的欄位會破壞 Schema 效能與維護性。







